            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nRequirements: The remnant of Barzillai is within Ravounel\n\nFrequency: 3/day\n\nThe remnant of Barzillai stirs up and amplifies unsettled spirits in the area to create a single haunt of 6th level or lower at his present location. This haunt is permanent until it is disabled or the remnant of Barzillai is destroyed."
